    "rationale": "Second pass: held the red/lapis/gold triad (rejected the reference's white), deepened the iwan into a true pointed ogee recess with a projecting gold pishtaq, gave both flanking niche stacks pointed arches and quartz tracery, engaged the corner minarets and chattris as relief bonded to the body (no detached pillars), banded the plinth and piers with string-courses to kill flat fields, and grew the gold onion dome so its belly overhangs the drum."
